      Solo los clics a tiempo hacen avanzar el kayak."
    explainEn: 'In the kayak you paddle with the mouse, ON THE BEAT: LEFT click to
      go RIGHT (you paddle on the left) and RIGHT click to go LEFT. Only clicks on
      time move the kayak.'
